    <briefdescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classllvm_1_1xray_1_1_instrumentation_map" kindref="compound">InstrumentationMap</ref> represents the computed function id&apos;s and indicated function addresses from an object file (or a YAML file). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This provides an interface to just the mapping between the function id, and the function address.</para>
<para>We also provide raw access to the actual instrumentation map entries we find associated with a particular object file. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
